{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "kronoqr-adoption",
  "title": "KronoQR · Impacto y adopción",
  "description": "Dirección y el propio fabricante en la venta. Jornadas con registro completo, reparto de fichajes por origen, ratio de correcciones, tiempo hasta resolver incidencias, credenciales pendientes (doc 02 §8.3, RF-IN-08). El cuadro que responde a '¿esto está sirviendo para algo?' y sostiene la renovación de la licencia.",
  "tags": ["kronoqr", "adopcion", "rf-in-08"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "style": "dark",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "liveNow": false,
  "time": { "from": "now-30d", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": { "refresh_intervals": ["1m", "5m"] },
  "links": [],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" },
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "name": "site",
        "label": "Centro",
        "options": [],
        "query": { "query": "label_values(pin_fallback_scans_total, site)", "refId": "StandardVariableQuery" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "regex": "",
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "sort": 1,
        "type": "query"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Jornadas con registro completo (ratio diario)",
      "description": "workdays_complete_ratio{site} (RF-IN-08). El indicador de impacto principal: mide si el sistema está cumpliendo su función. Un centro sin jornadas ese día NO publica serie: ausencia no es lo mismo que cero.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" }, "expr": "workdays_complete_ratio{site=~\"$site\"}", "legendFormat": "centro {{site}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "#EAB839", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.95 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "mean"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Fichajes totales (7 días)",
      "description": "sum(scans_by_origin_total). Da escala al ratio de jornadas completas de al lado: un ratio sobre pocos fichajes y uno sobre miles no significan lo mismo.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(increase(scans_by_origin_total[7d]))", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ratio de correcciones manuales / fichajes (7 días)",
      "description": "Si sube, el registro se está degradando: adopción real de la tarjeta frente al parche manual (doc 01 §9.2).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(manual_corrections_total[7d])) / sum(increase(scans_total[7d]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "#EAB839", "value": 0.05 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.15 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Reparto de fichajes por origen (7 días)",
      "description": "scans_by_origin_total{origin} — QR, PIN, corrección manual (RF-IN-08). Adopción real: si las correcciones manuales suben, el registro se está degradando.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (origin) (increase(scans_by_origin_total[7d]))", "legendFormat": "{{origin}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false },
        "pieType": "pie",
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "values": ["value", "percent"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Reparto de fichajes por origen — tendencia",
      "description": "sum by (origin) (rate(scans_by_origin_total[1h])) * 3600: fichajes por hora, por origen.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (origin) (rate(scans_by_origin_total[1h])) * 3600", "legendFormat": "{{origin}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto"
          },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tiempo hasta resolver una incidencia (p50 / p95), por tipo",
      "description": "incident_resolution_seconds{type} (doc 01 §9.2). Contraste con el objetivo de < 24 h del §1.3: línea de umbral en 86400 s.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, type) (rate(incident_resolution_seconds_bucket[7d])))", "legendFormat": "p50 {{type}}" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, type) (rate(incident_resolution_seconds_bucket[7d])))", "legendFormat": "p95 {{type}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 86400 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Empleados sin credencial entregada",
      "description": "employees_without_delivered_credential{site,site_name}: quién no puede fichar todavía. Debe ser cero antes de cada incorporación (doc 01 §9.2).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(employees_without_delivered_credential{site=~\"$site\"})", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "#EAB839", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Credenciales pendientes de imprimir",
      "description": "credentials_pending_print{site,site_name} (RF-QR-08).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(credentials_pending_print{site=~\"$site\"})", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "#EAB839", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Credenciales pendientes de reimpresión (rotación de clave)",
      "description": "credentials_pending_reprint{site,site_name,key_id} (RF-QR-07). Llega a cero cuando la clave saliente se puede retirar.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(credentials_pending_reprint{site=~\"$site\"})", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tarjetas activas con clave desconocida (DEBE ser 0)",
      "description": "credentials_active_unknown_key{site,site_name,key_id} (RF-QR-07). Quien lleve una de estas tarjetas no puede fichar y el panel no lo delata porque su fila se ve entregada.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "kronoqr-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(credentials_active_unknown_key{site=~\"$site\"})", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    }
  ]
}
